{"study_accession":"PRJNA762096","secondary_study_accession":"SRP336419","title":"Loss of FBXO11 establishes a stem cell program in acute myeloid leukemia by dysregulating LONP1 [RNA-seq]","description":"Purpose: The goals of this study are to compare the transcriptome profile of human cord blood derived CD34+ cells expressing shRNA targeting FBXO11, LONP1 or non-targeting shRNA, combined with or without over-expression of FLAG-FBXO11 or LONP1 by RNAseq. Methods: mRNA profiles of CD34+ cord blood cells with combinations of FBXO11 or LONP1 knockdown or over-expression were generated by RNAseq. Overall design: CD34+ cord blood expressing non-targeting shRNA, shRNA targeting human FBXO11, shRNA targeting human LONP1, empty vector, FLAG-FBXO11, LONP1, or a combination of one of the shRNAs with the over-expression of FLAG-FBXO11 or LONP1.","pubmed":"41289019","geo_series":"","n_samples":23,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN21371472","study_accession":"PRJNA762096","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Empty_2","description":"Empty_2","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5572670","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-08-16","attributes":[["source_name","Human cord-blood derived CD34+ cells"],["cell_type","CD34+ cord blood cells"],["overexpression","empty vector control"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR15834050","experiment_accession":"SRX12125559","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"HiSeq X Ten","read_count":45266420,"base_count":13579926000,"first_public":"2026-08-16","experiment_title":"HiSeq X Ten sequencing: GSM5572670: Empty_2 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN21371473","study_accession":"PRJNA762096","blood_class":"cord_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"Empty_3","description":"Empty_3","sex":"","geo_sample":"GSM5572671","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2026-08-16","attributes":[["source_name","Human cord-blood derived CD34+ cells"],["cell_type","C